# 1. TELL LINGUIST TO IGNORE ALL MARKDOWN AND DOCS IN THE STATS
*.md linguist-documentation
README.md linguist-documentation
docs/** linguist-documentation

# 2. Force GitHub to count your automation scripts
*.bat linguist-detectable linguist-language=Batchfile
*.cmd linguist-detectable linguist-language=Batchfile
*.ps1 linguist-detectable linguist-language=PowerShell
*.psm1 linguist-detectable linguist-language=PowerShell
*.sh linguist-detectable linguist-language=Shell
